---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Habits Pioneer"
  description="Privacy Policy for the Habits Pioneer app: what data we collect, how it is stored, and your rights over it."
>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p class="date">Last updated: July 10, 2026</p>

  <p>
    Habits Pioneer ("we", "our", or "the app") is a habit tracking and task management application. This
    Privacy Policy explains what data we collect, how we use it, and your rights over it.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Data We Collect</h2>
  <p>Habits Pioneer collects only the data you explicitly create inside the app:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Habits</strong> — name, emoji, frequency, and daily completion history</li>
    <li><strong>Tasks</strong> — title, priority, category, and completion status</li>
    <li><strong>Sleep logs</strong> — bedtime, wake time, quality rating, and habit checklist</li>
    <li><strong>Journal entries</strong> — mood, daily score, and reflections you write</li>
    <li><strong>App preferences</strong> — language, theme, and sounds setting</li>
    <li><strong>Email address</strong> — only if you choose to sign in with Google or Apple for cloud sync</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    We do <strong>not</strong> collect any information about how you use the app, device identifiers, location,
    contacts, photos, or any other data beyond what you enter.
  </p>

  <h2>2. How Data Is Stored</h2>
  <p>You have full control over where your data lives:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Local mode (no account required):</strong> All data is stored exclusively on your device using
      AsyncStorage. It never leaves your device. We have no access to it.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Cloud sync mode (optional):</strong> If you choose to sign in, your data is encrypted in transit and
      stored on <a href="https://supabase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Supabase</a> servers (hosted on AWS in
      the US). Only your account can access your data — enforced by Row Level Security policies.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Sign-In (Google &amp; Apple)</h2>
  <p>
    Cloud sync uses Google OAuth or Sign in with Apple through Supabase. When you sign in, we receive your email
    address and a unique identifier to link your data. We do not receive your password, contacts, calendar, or any
    other account data. If you use Sign in with Apple, you may choose to hide your email, in which case we only
    receive Apple's private relay address.
  </p>

  <h2>4. AI Coach Feature</h2>
  <p>
    Habits Pioneer includes an optional AI Coach feature powered by
    <a href="https://www.anthropic.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Anthropic</a> (Claude AI). When you use the AI
    Coach, the messages you send in that session are transmitted to Anthropic's API to generate a response.
    <strong>We do not store your conversations on our servers.</strong> Each session starts fresh — no chat history is
    saved or linked to your account.
  </p>
  <p>
    The AI Coach may receive a compact, anonymized summary of your habit data (e.g. "3 active habits, daily completion
    rate 70%") to personalize its responses. This summary is sent only during the session and is not stored. Anthropic
    processes messages in accordance with their
    <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>. You are never
    required to use the AI Coach.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p>Third-party services used by Habits Pioneer:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Supabase</a> — cloud sync (optional)</li>
    <li>
      <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Anthropic (Claude)</a> — AI Coach
      feature (optional, session-only, no data stored)
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not use advertising networks, analytics SDKs, or crash reporting services.</p>

  <h2>6. Data Retention &amp; Deletion</h2>
  <p><strong>Local mode:</strong> Your data exists only on your device. Deleting the app removes all data.</p>
  <p>
    <strong>Cloud mode:</strong> You can permanently delete your account and all associated cloud data at any time from
    within the app: go to <em>Settings → Cloud Sync → Delete account</em>. This action is irreversible. Your email
    address and all habit, task, sleep, and journal data will be permanently removed from our servers within 30 days.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell, rent, trade, or share your personal data with any third parties, except as required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    Habits Pioneer does not knowingly collect data from children under 13. If you believe a child has provided
    personal information, please contact us and we will delete it promptly.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by updating the date at the
    top of this page. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
  </p>

  <h2>10. Contact</h2>
  <p>
    If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or want to exercise your data rights, contact us at:
    <a href="mailto:aguslop0921@gmail.com">aguslop0921@gmail.com</a>
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
